  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Do you know why an AI Agent can become less useful after it remembers more? Keep it in mind.",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 5.376,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.167,
      "spokenEnd": 4.709,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Microsoft Research calls this the raw-history problem: long interaction logs mix useful experience with details that no longer matter.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.552,
      "audioStart": 4.712,
      "spokenStart": 4.869,
      "spokenEnd": 10.58,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Preserve the trace, but turn its decision-relevant parts into reusable knowledge.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.128,
      "audioStart": 10.515,
      "spokenStart": 10.68,
      "spokenEnd": 14.007,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Then the Agent searches a larger pile, spends context on noise, and can miss the fact or constraint that should change its next action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.6,
      "audioStart": 14.014,
      "spokenStart": 14.167,
      "spokenEnd": 19.965,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This episode gives you an AI Agent retain–distill–forget table: a simple way to decide what stays available, what becomes a compact lesson, and what should stop competing for attention.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.928,
      "audioStart": 19.97,
      "spokenStart": 20.125,
      "spokenEnd": 28.231,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The goal is not perfect memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.16,
      "audioStart": 28.242,
      "spokenStart": 28.391,
      "spokenEnd": 29.762,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It is decision-ready memory: the smallest set of facts and skills that helps an Agent act correctly now.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.112,
      "audioStart": 29.699,
      "spokenStart": 29.862,
      "spokenEnd": 34.178,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This video is packed with practical, high-value insights to help you get better at using AI.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.704,
      "audioStart": 34.183,
      "spokenStart": 34.338,
      "spokenEnd": 38.214,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It's a longer one, so follow Tiny Agent and save it so you don't lose it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.984,
      "audioStart": 38.164,
      "spokenStart": 38.314,
      "spokenEnd": 41.505,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter two: Raw History.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.256,
      "audioStart": 41.537,
      "spokenStart": 41.685,
      "spokenEnd": 43.167,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Learn why a complete log is not automatically a useful memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.456,
      "audioStart": 43.113,
      "spokenStart": 43.267,
      "spokenEnd": 45.88,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "An interaction record can contain a decision, a failed search, copied text, an obsolete plan, and a temporary tool error all at once.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.44,
      "audioStart": 45.88,
      "spokenStart": 46.04,
      "spokenEnd": 52.674,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Those items deserve different treatment because they answer different future questions.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.912,
      "audioStart": 52.619,
      "spokenStart": 52.774,
      "spokenEnd": 55.865,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Keeping that record is valuable for audit and recovery.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.976,
      "audioStart": 55.864,
      "spokenStart": 56.025,
      "spokenEnd": 58.166,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Sending all of it back into every new task is a different decision.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.408,
      "audioStart": 58.1,
      "spokenStart": 58.266,
      "spokenEnd": 60.835,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The more irrelevant detail the Agent retrieves, the harder it becomes to identify the condition that actually changes the current answer.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.096,
      "audioStart": 60.835,
      "spokenStart": 60.995,
      "spokenEnd": 66.232,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "That is why larger memory can feel like better recall while producing slower, less reliable reasoning.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.968,
      "audioStart": 66.239,
      "spokenStart": 66.392,
      "spokenEnd": 70.556,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Retrieval quality matters more than the visible size of the archive.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.552,
      "audioStart": 70.507,
      "spokenStart": 70.656,
      "spokenEnd": 73.407,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Treat history as a source to process, not a bag that must be poured into the next context window.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.92,
      "audioStart": 73.409,
      "spokenStart": 73.567,
      "spokenEnd": 77.658,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.56,
      "audioStart": 77.671,
      "spokenStart": 77.818,
      "spokenEnd": 78.582,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, keep raw history for traceability, not as the default prompt.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.936,
      "audioStart": 78.527,
      "spokenStart": 78.682,
      "spokenEnd": 81.809,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, separate the value of storing an event from the value of retrieving it now.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.32,
      "audioStart": 81.812,
      "spokenStart": 81.969,
      "spokenEnd": 85.468,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, judge memory by whether it improves the next decision.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.36,
      "audioStart": 85.465,
      "spokenStart": 85.628,
      "spokenEnd": 88.166,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter three: Useful Units.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.4,
      "audioStart": 88.192,
      "spokenStart": 88.346,
      "spokenEnd": 89.955,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Turn experience into things an AI Agent can reuse.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 89.909,
      "spokenStart": 90.055,
      "spokenEnd": 92.575,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The Microsoft Research article describes a shift from storing text chunks toward structured knowledge.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.848,
      "audioStart": 92.585,
      "spokenStart": 92.735,
      "spokenEnd": 96.795,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "One useful unit is a fact: a verified constraint, a current setting, or a result that narrows what the Agent can safely do.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.408,
      "audioStart": 96.8,
      "spokenStart": 96.955,
      "spokenEnd": 102.542,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It should also name the scope in which that conclusion remains trustworthy.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.648,
      "audioStart": 102.479,
      "spokenStart": 102.642,
      "spokenEnd": 105.441,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Another is a reusable skill: a compact procedure that says when to take an action, what evidence to collect, and when to stop.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.336,
      "audioStart": 105.439,
      "spokenStart": 105.601,
      "spokenEnd": 111.141,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Facts answer what is true enough for this task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.76,
      "audioStart": 111.142,
      "spokenStart": 111.301,
      "spokenEnd": 113.244,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Skills answer how to proceed when the same pattern appears again.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.336,
      "audioStart": 113.183,
      "spokenStart": 113.344,
      "spokenEnd": 115.883,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This transformation removes repeated narration without throwing away the lesson contained in the interaction.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.896,
      "audioStart": 115.889,
      "spokenStart": 116.043,
      "spokenEnd": 120.118,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 120.131,
      "spokenStart": 120.278,
      "spokenEnd": 121.045,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, promote verified facts out of raw transcripts.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.432,
      "audioStart": 120.98,
      "spokenStart": 121.145,
      "spokenEnd": 123.756,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, capture repeatable procedures as skills, not anecdotes.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.08,
      "audioStart": 123.749,
      "spokenStart": 123.916,
      "spokenEnd": 127.195,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, keep each unit small enough to guide one future decision.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.672,
      "audioStart": 127.192,
      "spokenStart": 127.355,
      "spokenEnd": 130.189,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter four: Task Routing.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.304,
      "audioStart": 130.213,
      "spokenStart": 130.369,
      "spokenEnd": 131.87,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Retrieve only the knowledge that belongs to the task in front of you.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.24,
      "audioStart": 131.827,
      "spokenStart": 131.97,
      "spokenEnd": 134.419,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "PlugMem uses high-level concepts and inferred intent as routing signals instead of returning long passages by default.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.048,
      "audioStart": 134.409,
      "spokenStart": 134.579,
      "spokenEnd": 139.817,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "In practical terms, start with the current goal, the entity, the risk, and the next action that needs support.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.664,
      "audioStart": 139.817,
      "spokenStart": 139.977,
      "spokenEnd": 144.848,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "These cues shrink retrieval before the Agent begins comparing evidence.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.768,
      "audioStart": 144.796,
      "spokenStart": 144.948,
      "spokenEnd": 147.936,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Use those cues to select a few relevant facts and skills.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.384,
      "audioStart": 147.939,
      "spokenStart": 148.096,
      "spokenEnd": 150.675,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Do not retrieve every record that shares a broad keyword.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 150.619,
      "spokenStart": 150.775,
      "spokenEnd": 153.071,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Before the selected memory reaches the base Agent, distill it into concise guidance: what is known, what matters, and what must still be checked.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.248,
      "audioStart": 153.065,
      "spokenStart": 153.231,
      "spokenEnd": 159.671,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If the answer depends on live information, retrieval is not enough.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.696,
      "audioStart": 159.672,
      "spokenStart": 159.831,
      "spokenEnd": 162.716,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The Agent still needs fresh evidence from the appropriate source.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.312,
      "audioStart": 162.651,
      "spokenStart": 162.816,
      "spokenEnd": 165.319,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 165.332,
      "spokenStart": 165.479,
      "spokenEnd": 166.251,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, route memory from the current decision, not from a vague topic match.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.104,
      "audioStart": 166.188,
      "spokenStart": 166.351,
      "spokenEnd": 169.633,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, pass compact guidance instead of a transcript.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.432,
      "audioStart": 169.636,
      "spokenStart": 169.793,
      "spokenEnd": 172.41,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, use fresh evidence whenever the task can change over time.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.768,
      "audioStart": 172.406,
      "spokenStart": 172.57,
      "spokenEnd": 175.516,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter five: Memory Lifecycle.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.616,
      "audioStart": 175.538,
      "spokenStart": 175.696,
      "spokenEnd": 177.501,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Decide whether each item should remain, shrink, or leave the working set.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.96,
      "audioStart": 177.437,
      "spokenStart": 177.601,
      "spokenEnd": 180.759,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Retain an item when it is verified, likely to affect future decisions, and still has a clear retrieval cue.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.616,
      "audioStart": 180.762,
      "spokenStart": 180.919,
      "spokenEnd": 185.723,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Distill an item when the event is long but its lesson can be expressed as a fact, rule, checklist, or handoff note.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.976,
      "audioStart": 185.724,
      "spokenStart": 185.883,
      "spokenEnd": 191.07,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "A compact lesson should remain understandable without reopening the entire incident.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.272,
      "audioStart": 191.006,
      "spokenStart": 191.17,
      "spokenEnd": 194.607,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Forget an item from active memory when it is obsolete, duplicated, low-confidence, or only useful as audit history.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.12,
      "audioStart": 194.61,
      "spokenStart": 194.767,
      "spokenEnd": 200.025,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Forgetting from the working set is not deleting evidence.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3,
      "audioStart": 200.025,
      "spokenStart": 200.185,
      "spokenEnd": 202.395,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Keep the original trace where governance or debugging requires it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.36,
      "audioStart": 202.335,
      "spokenStart": 202.495,
      "spokenEnd": 205.028,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Review dates matter because a once-correct policy, tool result, or customer preference can become misleading after conditions change.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.408,
      "audioStart": 205.039,
      "spokenStart": 205.188,
      "spokenEnd": 210.802,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 210.815,
      "spokenStart": 210.962,
      "spokenEnd": 211.739,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, retain durable facts with future decision value.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 211.685,
      "spokenStart": 211.839,
      "spokenEnd": 214.501,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, distill long experience into a reusable rule or skill.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.792,
      "audioStart": 214.504,
      "spokenStart": 214.661,
      "spokenEnd": 217.618,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, remove stale or duplicate material from active retrieval without losing the audit trail.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.16,
      "audioStart": 217.616,
      "spokenStart": 217.778,
      "spokenEnd": 222.097,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter six: Memory Table.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.376,
      "audioStart": 222.144,
      "spokenStart": 222.277,
      "spokenEnd": 223.883,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Apply the retain–distill–forget decision before your Agent's next long task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.32,
      "audioStart": 223.827,
      "spokenStart": 223.983,
      "spokenEnd": 227.507,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Give every candidate item six fields: the item, its next-task value, its state, its compact form, its retrieval cue, and its review date.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.04,
      "audioStart": 227.515,
      "spokenStart": 227.667,
      "spokenEnd": 234.897,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "This makes a memory decision inspectable instead of hiding it inside a growing prompt.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.176,
      "audioStart": 234.835,
      "spokenStart": 234.997,
      "spokenEnd": 238.362,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If a deployment constraint changes permissions, retain the verified constraint with the system and action that need it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.304,
      "audioStart": 238.362,
      "spokenStart": 238.522,
      "spokenEnd": 243.026,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If a troubleshooting session reveals a repeatable fix, distill it into a short skill with a trigger, steps, evidence, and stopping condition.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.888,
      "audioStart": 243.023,
      "spokenStart": 243.186,
      "spokenEnd": 249.273,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Keep the form short enough to scan during a live task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 249.217,
      "spokenStart": 249.373,
      "spokenEnd": 251.679,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If five transcripts repeat the same discovery, keep one traceable source and retire the duplicates from active retrieval.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.952,
      "audioStart": 251.676,
      "spokenStart": 251.839,
      "spokenEnd": 256.951,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If you cannot name the next decision an item could improve, it probably does not deserve a permanent place in the Agent's working memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.976,
      "audioStart": 256.951,
      "spokenStart": 257.111,
      "spokenEnd": 262.236,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 262.249,
      "spokenStart": 262.396,
      "spokenEnd": 263.173,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, write the decision value before saving memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.24,
      "audioStart": 263.119,
      "spokenStart": 263.273,
      "spokenEnd": 265.688,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, choose retain, distill, or forget deliberately.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.744,
      "audioStart": 265.687,
      "spokenStart": 265.848,
      "spokenEnd": 268.761,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, attach a retrieval cue and review date so memory can stay useful.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.2,
      "audioStart": 268.759,
      "spokenStart": 268.921,
      "spokenEnd": 272.285,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "An AI Agent does not become wiser by carrying every past message into every future task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 4.944,
      "audioStart": 272.306,
      "spokenStart": 272.465,
      "spokenEnd": 276.617,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Raw history remains useful for audit, but reusable facts and skills are usually better inputs for action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.496,
      "audioStart": 276.617,
      "spokenStart": 276.777,
      "spokenEnd": 281.453,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Route memory from the current decision, then distill the result until the Agent can see what matters without reading the whole past.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.76,
      "audioStart": 281.458,
      "spokenStart": 281.613,
      "spokenEnd": 286.559,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Use the retain–distill–forget table to make storage, retrieval, and retirement explicit instead of accidental.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.904,
      "audioStart": 286.565,
      "spokenStart": 286.719,
      "spokenEnd": 291.783,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The research result is encouraging, but treat it as evidence for testing your own memory design, not as a universal performance guarantee.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.6,
      "audioStart": 291.776,
      "spokenStart": 291.943,
      "spokenEnd": 297.679,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Review one retained item after the task to see whether it actually improved the outcome.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.2,
      "audioStart": 297.63,
      "spokenStart": 297.779,
      "spokenEnd": 301.167,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Follow Tiny Agent.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.824,
      "audioStart": 301.165,
      "spokenStart": 301.327,
      "spokenEnd": 302.353,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Tiny Agent helps you get better at using AI.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 2.688,
      "audioStart": 302.296,
      "spokenStart": 302.453,
      "spokenEnd": 304.314,
